<title>USA: Onyx tests show tumor drug is safe.</title>
<headline>Onyx tests show tumor drug is safe.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Calif. 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Onyx Pharmaceuticals Inc said Monday that initial results of Phase I tests of its drug ONYX-015, targeted to treat head and neck tumors, show it to be safe and well-tolerated.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said it expects to begin Phase II trials by midyear to determine the drug's efficacy in the same patient population.</p>
<p>ONYX-015 is a genetically engineered adenovirus that in preclinical studies efficiently replicated in and killed tumor cells deficient in the p53 tumor suppressor gene.</p>
</text>
